Z||000011||Dragon||08-11-2001||12:00 AM||||This is one of the premier events in the Southeast.  All you have to do is come and have fun.  The Fiero does not have to look pretty.  Ltl Bro Broad (Dixieland Fieros) started this event 6 years in Helen, Georgia and it has moved around a bit since then.  There has never been a bad event.<P>------------------<BR>Dragon<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://spacecoastfieros.com/dragon.jpg">   <P>   Space Coast Fieros||||reg||10
Z||000012||FieroHarry||08-11-2001||07:19 AM||||Last year we had 23 Fiero's show up and everyone had fun.<BR>The entire run lasted from 8AM to late into the afternoon and was some of the smoothest, twistyest roads you will ever come across.<BR>Deals gap across the mountains has 318 turns in 11 miles and will leave you feeling like Andretti,Unser etc etc. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR><BR><B>"If you want to blend in, take the bus!"</B>||||reg||6
Z||000013||8Ball||08-11-2001||07:43 AM||||I know the Gap well, It has been used for profesional Motorcycle races. And loads of fun. I can't wait to drive it in a Fiero.<BR>Randy||||reg||1
Z||000014||Songman||08-11-2001||12:41 PM||||Yep, that stretch of road was made for motorcycles! They even have a motorcycle-only motel there!<P>It is great on a motorcycle, and even in a sports car... but I took my ex-wife (not ex at the time) and her kids across there on the way to Gatlinburg one time and the kids were getting car sick bad! A Jeep Grand Cherokee is not the best vehicle for that road!<P>I plan to be in Cherokee for the run!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||6
Z||000015||Wolfhound||08-11-2001||01:13 PM||||I plan on being there for the run as well. I,ve drove  Deals Gap (The Dragon) several times but never in a Fiero.<BR>Added:<BR>I just did a search on "Deals Gap" 1400 hits. more photos than you can look at in a day.<BR>Check them out!<p>[This message has been edited by Wolfhound (edited 08-11-2001).]||||reg||14
